"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>版本6.0，2026-10-13。接口资格以原子中的证据字段为准。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>接口与边界</th>\n<th>原子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>原始/扩充语法</td>\n<td>Fml72为自由逻辑构造，向72内部基础语法显式翻译</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"../72-df-calculus-syntax\">../72-df-calculus-syntax</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有序相继式</td>\n<td>CtxSeq²；保留次序和重数</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" href=\"?note=c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" title=\"../72-df-sequence-sequent\">../72-df-sequence-sequent</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带标注证明树</td>\n<td>五元地址树与实际rule tag/witness；四元仅∃η投影</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"../72-df-proof-tree\">../72-df-proof-tree</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LK/LJ</td>\n<td>完整逻辑规则；LJ有独立析取引入分支</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"../72-df-gentzen-system\">../72-df-gentzen-system</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然演绎</td>\n<td>开放假设标签、解除和特征变量均由真实规则给出</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4c916f34e9cc3391\" href=\"?note=4c916f34e9cc3391\" title=\"../72-df-natural-deduction\">../72-df-natural-deduction</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ω证明</td>\n<td>可数前提与孩子关系良基性分开</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f57c523092bba1d6\" href=\"?note=f57c523092bba1d6\" title=\"../72-df-omega-proof\">../72-df-omega-proof</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算术L2</td>\n<td>两类变量的有效演算；不同于全二阶语义</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"../72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">../72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PA/NT</td>\n<td>PA一阶；NT为PR函数与自由集参数保守扩展</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"../72-df-peano-arithmetic\">../72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证明论序数</td>\n<td>Π¹₁/自由集参数约定；PR良序与对象TI公式分开</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"../72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">../72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ε0记号</td>\n<td>有限规范CNF列表、递归字典序、明确数码</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"../72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">../72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Buchholz ψ</td>\n<td>固定Ων、Cν和ψν递归；不接受任意ψ占位</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0834bea6989e10f4\" href=\"?note=0834bea6989e10f4\" title=\"../72-df-buchholz-psi\">../72-df-buchholz-psi</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自治序数</td>\n<td>真实无穷语法与自主闭包，证据边界见节点</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"5f74371081322951\" href=\"?note=5f74371081322951\" title=\"../72-thm-predicative-bound\">../72-thm-predicative-bound</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RCA/ACA/ATR</td>\n<td>句子集合与概括/递归模式明确</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"../72-df-base-system\">../72-df-base-system</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BASIC与有界归纳</td>\n<td>32公理及IND/PIND/LIND分开</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"f08305bb0d508a7d\" href=\"?note=f08305bb0d508a7d\" title=\"../72-df-basic-axioms\">../72-df-basic-axioms</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cook–Reckhow</td>\n<td>串函数证明系统与带规则演算分开</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"../72-df-propositional-proof-system\">../72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模拟与p模拟</td>\n<td>多项式长度存在界与多项式时间转换分开</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"b16c13e741889b14\" href=\"?note=b16c13e741889b14\" title=\"../72-df-proof-system-comparison\">../72-df-proof-system-comparison</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PHP强下界</td>\n<td>两类子句；指数下界使用line度量和一手来源</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"53a60483631f158b\" href=\"?note=53a60483631f158b\" title=\"../72-thm-php-resolution-lower\">../72-thm-php-resolution-lower</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树序数层级</td>\n<td>G/H/B/F参数与形式树记号明确</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"../72-df-tree-ordinal\">../72-df-tree-ordinal</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数实现性</td>\n<td>元关系与环境更新、部分计算界面明确</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"../72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">../72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GL</td>\n<td>模态语法、推导、模型及算术实现分别定义</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"../72-df-godel-lob-logic\">../72-df-godel-lob-logic</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性逻辑</td>\n<td>独立多重集与one-sided规则；不与LK上下文混用</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"../72-df-linear-logic\">../72-df-linear-logic</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证明网</td>\n<td>适用片段与切换图正确性见精确节点</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"a1bf25d5239f3f6e\" href=\"?note=a1bf25d5239f3f6e\" title=\"../72-df-proof-net\">../72-df-proof-net</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型与归约</td>\n<td>显式语法、代换、typing与compatible reduction</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"../72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">../72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四值语义</td>\n<td>信息序与逻辑∧/∨不同</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"0572b6bbfb593e05\" href=\"?note=0572b6bbfb593e05\" title=\"../72-df-four-valued-truth\">../72-df-four-valued-truth</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>程序envelope</td>\n<td>固定域/函数解释上的单调算子与最小充分结构</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"6c4d010edfaaea6b\" href=\"?note=6c4d010edfaaea6b\" title=\"../72-df-program-envelope\">../72-df-program-envelope</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算术标准真值</td>\n<td>AT(A,η)，标准自然数结构的外部真值；不是HA内部真谓词</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"../72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">../72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数真实现性</td>\n<td>NRT(n,A,η)，蕴涵子句显式增加原公式真值</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-29\" data-note=\"e39710a1818d0447\" href=\"?note=e39710a1818d0447\" title=\"../72-df-number-realizability-with-truth\">../72-df-number-realizability-with-truth</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负算术片段</td>\n<td>原子、假、合取、蕴涵、全称的最小闭包；排除原始析取/存在</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-30\" data-note=\"bb78d8a03236bc57\" href=\"?note=bb78d8a03236bc57\" title=\"../72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment\">../72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GL带假设推导</td>\n<td>只对定理必然化；临时假设闭包只用MP</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-31\" data-note=\"2b98f8844a547104\" href=\"?note=2b98f8844a547104\" title=\"../72-df-modal-assumption-derivability\">../72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模态adequate集</td>\n<td>子公式与外层否定增删封闭，指定有限闭包Φ_A</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-32\" data-note=\"67a60f891de62bc0\" href=\"?note=67a60f891de62bc0\" title=\"../72-df-modal-adequate-set\">../72-df-modal-adequate-set</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GL有限典范模型</td>\n<td>R_Φ保持方框及内容，并严格增加方框；支持有限反模型</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-33\" data-note=\"a84520417d5eb9a3\" href=\"?note=a84520417d5eb9a3\" title=\"../72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model\">../72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Clark等式理论</td>\n<td>CET的不可合一/最一般合一子模式；DCA只对有限签名</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-34\" data-note=\"2d49b9fae2b96976\" href=\"?note=2d49b9fae2b96976\" title=\"../72-df-clark-equational-theory\">../72-df-clark-equational-theory</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有限envelope迭代</td>\n<td>任意M的迭代递增须M⊑E_P(M)；从底出发自动满足</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-35\" data-note=\"7fdc7a7a93d79109\" href=\"?note=7fdc7a7a93d79109\" title=\"../72-df-finite-envelope-iteration\">../72-df-finite-envelope-iteration</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有限阶段展开</td>\n<td>E_P^n为等式公式；负字面量先否定定义式再递归</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-36\" data-note=\"59d9dc7ce0d1cae1\" href=\"?note=59d9dc7ce0d1cae1\" title=\"../72-df-finite-stage-expansion\">../72-df-finite-stage-expansion</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无identity程序演算</td>\n<td>有限集合Tait推导，保留CET公理；秩界0同时无cut</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-37\" data-note=\"62a32ca4e63fca90\" href=\"?note=62a32ca4e63fca90\" title=\"../72-df-identity-free-program-calculus\">../72-df-identity-free-program-calculus</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分程序completion</td>\n<td>正负signed关系独立；两个闭包方向均显式给出</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-38\" data-note=\"86860ecaa6585b53\" href=\"?note=86860ecaa6585b53\" title=\"../72-df-partial-program-completion\">../72-df-partial-program-completion</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PER</td>\n<td>对称、传递，支撑上为等价关系；空PER允许</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-39\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"../72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">../72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求值相容PER</td>\n<td>固定确定、幂等求值与Kleene相等饱和；预求值扩张</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-40\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"../72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">../72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PER积</td>\n<td>pair值的分量关系再作预求值扩张</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-41\" data-note=\"5c65f237e17c892c\" href=\"?note=5c65f237e17c892c\" title=\"../72-df-per-cartesian-product\">../72-df-per-cartesian-product</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PER类型系统</td>\n<td>类型相等E与成员相等L(a)分层；L在E类上不变</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-42\" data-note=\"9e7370aef3007b80\" href=\"?note=9e7370aef3007b80\" title=\"../72-df-per-type-system\">../72-df-per-type-system</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型系统扩张</td>\n<td>扩充类型相等，同时保持旧类型的成员关系；有向并</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-43\" data-note=\"986fa2bc3322b549\" href=\"?note=986fa2bc3322b549\" title=\"../72-df-per-type-system-extension\">../72-df-per-type-system-extension</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带底cpo</td>\n<td>非空有向族存在上确界；一般单调不动点证明用超限迭代</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-44\" data-note=\"d3eb2e8e337f64cc\" href=\"?note=d3eb2e8e337f64cc\" title=\"../72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order\">../72-df-pointed-directed-complete-order</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树序数算术</td>\n<td>overline n、bold omega、⊕、⊗、Pow；保留基本序列，不与外延序数算术混同</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-45\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"../72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">../72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化前驱穷尽</td>\n<td>α[n]递增且穷尽严格子树；下游良序与最终支配分别证明</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-46\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"../72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">../72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化层次比较</td>\n<td>G/H/B/F输入单调；F层间严格比较要求n&gt;0</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-47\" data-note=\"8d01f06a62827a91\" href=\"?note=8d01f06a62827a91\" title=\"../72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity\">../72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>System T全类型层级</td>\n<td>H_σ包含全部集合函数；默认元素不成为对象常元</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-48\" data-note=\"3d4a0f770a100777\" href=\"?note=3d4a0f770a100777\" title=\"../72-df-system-t-full-type-hierarchy\">../72-df-system-t-full-type-hierarchy</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>System T指称</td>\n<td>带类型全赋值、recursor参数a/b/n、有限项树语义</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-49\" data-note=\"9c9169e498db491f\" href=\"?note=9c9169e498db491f\" title=\"../72-df-system-t-denotation\">../72-df-system-t-denotation</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T0无量词真值</td>\n<td>χ_η及模型满足，只有type0等式原子</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-50\" data-note=\"c0b8e7bc07374e97\" href=\"?note=c0b8e7bc07374e97\" title=\"../72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics\">../72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dialectica局部MP</td>\n<td>前件见证与后件挑战共同给前件挑战；空元组允许</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-51\" data-note=\"35681d457f526cf1\" href=\"?note=35681d457f526cf1\" title=\"../72-lem-dialectica-modus-ponens\">../72-lem-dialectica-modus-ponens</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>∀∃等式句ND矩阵</td>\n<td>现有N原子双否定使最终矩阵为四否定；T0中等价于原等式</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-52\" data-note=\"46e9f1b57ca011bf\" href=\"?note=46e9f1b57ca011bf\" title=\"../72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix\">../72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>System T见证提取</td>\n<td>精确限制到算术等式矩阵；继承完整解释定理的未核验限制</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-53\" data-note=\"b8200155e858da77\" href=\"?note=b8200155e858da77\" title=\"../72-thm-dialectica-pi02-equation-witnessing\">../72-thm-dialectica-pi02-equation-witnessing</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子句与有限赋值语义</td>\n<td>空子句是假、空CNF是真；公式有限赋值用零扩展连接全赋值</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-54\" data-note=\"a7ea013f9a55dcda\" href=\"?note=a7ea013f9a55dcda\" title=\"../72-df-clause-semantics\">../72-df-clause-semantics</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tseitin门子句</td>\n<td>复制/否定/合取/析取四标签，输出名不同于输入</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-55\" data-note=\"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" href=\"?note=1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" title=\"../72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses\">../72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tseitin公式编码</td>\n<td>有限子公式闭包、单射新命名、正负根单位子句</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-56\" data-note=\"9192b374640dde9c\" href=\"?note=9192b374640dde9c\" title=\"../72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding\">../72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展归结</td>\n<td>顺序新鲜且无环门定义，加定义子句后作归结反驳</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-57\" data-note=\"a06ff8011d8167f1\" href=\"?note=a06ff8011d8167f1\" title=\"../72-df-extended-resolution\">../72-df-extended-resolution</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><h3 id=\"本次补齐的共用定义\">本次补齐的共用定义</h3>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-58\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"../72-df-acceptable-numbering\">可接受的部分递归编号</a>：明确通用计算图、定义域以及 s-m-n 选码条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"本次补齐的共用定义","text":"本次补齐的共用定义","level":3}],"links":[{"target":"../72-df-symbol-index","status":"resolved","id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../72-df-symbol-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"../72-df-symbol-index","status":"resolved","id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal G_{72}$ 取 [[../72-df-symbol-index]] 的显式有限定义；本节点仅给出同一对象的导航入口，不从下方历史表格推断输入或前提。","embed":false},{"target":"../72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[../72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"../72-df-sequence-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"c9f8d8c86ed32f12","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[../72-df-sequence-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"../72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"../72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[../72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"../72-df-natural-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","loca